<title>RUSSIA: Russia '96 beet harvest revised up to 16.1 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia '96 beet harvest revised up to 16.1 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's 1996 sugar beet harvest has been revised up slightly to 16.1 million tonnes from a previously estimated 16.0 million, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said that 1995's official sugar beet harvest was 19.1 million tonnes, below the average 21.7 million tonnes seen each year over 1991-95.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
